---
import LegalPage from "../components/LegalPage.astro";
import Layout from "../components/Layout.astro";
import { site, supportMailto } from "../data/site";
---

<Layout
  title="Terms"
  description="Cook Club terms covering accounts, user content, moderation, subscriptions, and support."
>
  <LegalPage
    title="Terms"
    intro="These terms explain the rules for using Cook Club, including user content, community behavior, moderation, and subscriptions."
  >
    <p><strong>Last updated:</strong> {site.lastUpdated}</p>
    <p>
      By using Cook Club, you agree to these Terms. If you do not agree, do not
      use Cook Club.
    </p>
    <p>
      Cook Club is the app brand for this service and is developed by
      {site.developer}.
    </p>

    <h2>Accounts</h2>
    <p>
      You are responsible for your account and for keeping your sign-in method
      secure. You must provide accurate account information and use Cook Club in
      a lawful way.
    </p>
    <p>
      You must be at least 13 years old to create or use a Cook Club account.
      You must accept the current, versioned Terms before publishing recipes,
      activity, reviews, comments, or public profile content.
    </p>

    <h2>User Content</h2>
    <p>
      Cook Club lets users upload, save, create, review, comment on, and share
      content, including recipes, images, text, meal plans, shopping lists, and
      profile information. You keep ownership of content you upload, but you give
      Cook Club permission to host, process, display, copy, resize, and transmit
      that content as needed to operate the app.
    </p>
    <p>
      You must own or have the necessary rights to anything you upload or share
      through Cook Club. Do not upload content that infringes someone else's
      copyright, trademark, privacy, publicity, or other rights.
    </p>

    <h2>Content and Conduct Rules</h2>
    <p>You may not use Cook Club to create, upload, share, or promote:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Illegal content or activity.</li>
      <li>Abusive, threatening, harassing, bullying, or exploitative behavior.</li>
      <li>Hateful, discriminatory, or dehumanizing content.</li>
      <li>Sexually explicit content or content involving sexual exploitation.</li>
      <li>Violent, self-harm, dangerous, or unsafe instructions unrelated to normal cooking use.</li>
      <li>Spam, scams, impersonation, deception, or attempts to manipulate Cook Club systems.</li>
      <li>Content that infringes intellectual property or other legal rights.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Moderation and Enforcement</h2>
    <p>
      Cook Club may review, restrict, remove, or hide content that violates these
      Terms or creates risk for users, the service, or third parties. Cook Club
      may suspend or terminate accounts, limit features, block uploads, or take
      other action where needed to enforce these Terms or respond to abuse,
      safety, legal, or security concerns.
    </p>
    <p>
      To report content or behavior, contact <a href={supportMailto}>{site.supportEmail}</a>.
    </p>
    <p>
      The app also provides separate controls to report users or content and to
      block users. Blocking removes follows in both directions and hides the
      users and their content from one another. Unblocking does not restore
      previous follows. Reports may be retained with an evidence snapshot even
      if the reported content is later hidden or deleted.
    </p>

    <h2>Subscriptions</h2>
    <p>
      Some Cook Club features may require a paid subscription. Subscriptions are
      managed through Apple, Google, or another payment provider shown at
      purchase. Deleting your Cook Club account or uninstalling the app does not
      automatically cancel a subscription managed by Apple or Google.
    </p>
    <p>
      Cook Club Pro is offered as monthly and annual automatically renewing
      subscriptions. Launch plans do not include a free trial. The localized
      price and billing period are shown before purchase. Payment is charged to
      your App Store or Google Play account at confirmation and renews unless
      cancelled at least 24 hours before the end of the current period. You can
      manage or cancel through the store where you subscribed, and restore an
      eligible purchase in the app.
    </p>

    <h2>Service Changes</h2>
    <p>
      Cook Club may add, change, limit, or remove features. We may also suspend
      or stop the service if needed for operational, legal, security, or business
      reasons.
    </p>

    <h2>Disclaimers</h2>
    <p>
      Cook Club is provided as a cooking and organization tool. Recipes,
      generated suggestions, nutritional estimates, timing, substitutions, and
      shopping information may be incomplete or inaccurate. You are responsible
      for food safety, allergies, dietary needs, cooking decisions, and checking
      ingredients before use.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Questions about these Terms can be sent to
      <a href={supportMailto}>{site.supportEmail}</a>.
    </p>
  </LegalPage>
</Layout>
